Sentence 4: Street tires will also include wear limit indicators in the form of small raised bridges within the grooves.
Sentence 5: Sipes are slits cut across the tire, usually perpendicular to the grooves, which allow the water from the grooves to escape to the sides in an effort to prevent hydroplaning.
