Sentence 1: Pictures at an Exhibition
Pictures at an Exhibition Pictures at an Exhibition (, "Kartínki s výstavki – Vospominániye o Víktore Gártmane", "Pictures from an Exhibition – A Remembrance of Viktor Hartmann"; ) is a suite of ten pieces (plus a recurring, varied Promenade) composed for piano by Russian composer Modest Mussorgsky in 1874.
Sentence 2: Pictures at an Exhibition (Stokowski orchestration)
