Sentence 1: Bishōjo game
Bishōjo game A , or , is "a type of Japanese video game centered on interactions with attractive girls".
Sentence 2: These games are a subgenre of dating sims targeted towards a heterosexual male audience.
Sentence 3: Bishōjo games are similar to "Choose Your Own Adventure" books in the way of narrative, in which the game tells a story but the player may make choices to change how the story flows.
Sentence 4: Bishōjo games are a uniquely Japanese phenomenon.
