Sentence 3: Pericles had such a profound influence on Athenian society that Thucydides, a contemporary historian, acclaimed him as "the first citizen of Athens".
Sentence 4: Pericles turned the Delian League into an Athenian empire, and led his countrymen during the first two years of the Peloponnesian War.
