Sentence 2: While Macau is known as the gaming capital of the world and heavily relies on tourism, Hong Kong is the second major source of tourists of Macau.
Sentence 3: On the other hand, while Hong Kong is the world's most popular tourist destination, Macau is the sixth visitor source market of Hong Kong, just after the Mainland China, Taiwan, United States, and Japan.
