Sentence 1: Hester Prynne
Hester Prynne Hester Prynne is the protagonist of Nathaniel Hawthorne's novel "The Scarlet Letter".
Sentence 2: According to some writers and by popular tradition, aspects of Pain's life and her gravestone are considered an inspiration for the life and grave of character Hester Prynne in the novel "The Scarlet Letter" by Nathaniel Hawthorne.
