Sentence 1: Portuguese Podengo
Portuguese Podengo The Portuguese Podengo is an ancient multi-sensory hound (sight and scent) breed of dog from Portugal.
Sentence 2: Portuguese Podengo
All Podengo types are hardy, intelligent and lively dogs, excelling at agility and making fine companions.
Sentence 3: Loyal and fearless, Podengos are also good house guards and are amenable to training by dog experienced people and those that enjoy primitive (unrefined, "less domesticated") dog behavior.
Sentence 4: Keen hunting dogs, the Podengo has an affinity for game regardless of size.
Sentence 5: Typically, the dogs hunt in a pack with their handler following.
