Sentence 2: Most flights to Kalaupapa originate from Molokai Airport or from airports on the other Hawaiian islands by unscheduled air taxis and general aviation.
Sentence 3: It is also used as a cargo facility carrying goods for Kalaupapa, which has no road access from the rest of Molokai.
